{"uid":"48f35c7beebb3c97","name":"test_the_rate_budget_is_shared_not_per_process","fullName":"tests.test_routes_services#test_the_rate_budget_is_shared_not_per_process","historyId":"be749b68de198cf6d2600c05be24012e","time":{"start":1789882585171,"stop":1789882585481,"duration":310},"description":"The ceiling belongs to the service, not to whichever replica served the call.\n\n    The budget used to be a module-level dict, so `rate_limit_per_minute` was enforced per\n    process: three replicas granted three times the configured limit. Every review since\n    the limiter landed recorded that as open.\n\n    A second replica cannot be started in-process, so the property is asserted where it\n    actually lives — the shared table. Charges must be durable rows, not memory, because\n    that is the only thing another replica could possibly observe.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>The ceiling belongs to the service, not to whichever replica served the call.</p>\n<pre><code>The budget used to be a module-level dict, so `rate_limit_per_minute` was enforced per\nprocess: three replicas granted three times the configured limit. Every review since\nthe limiter landed recorded that as open.\n\nA second replica cannot be started in-process, so the property is asserted where it\nactually lives — the shared table. Charges must be durable rows, not memory, because\nthat is the only thing another replica could possibly observe.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789881489076,"stop":1789881489077,"duration":1},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1789881489114,"stop":1789881489114,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"p